  MIPStarRE.LDT.ev strategy.state (MIPStarRE.LDT.opTensor (Ah * (MIPStarRE.LDT.SelfImprovement.sandwichedPolynomialSubMeasAt params strategy T u).outcome h' * Ah) (T.outcome h)) = (if h.toFun u = h'.toFun u then 1 else 0) * MIPStarRE.LDT.ev strategy.state (MIPStarRE.LDT.opTensor ((MIPStarRE.LDT.SelfImprovement.sandwichedPolynomialSubMeasAt params strategy T u).outcome h') (T.outcome h))

